                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning_1.4.0"&gt;Azure.Provisioning_1.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.4.0 (2025-12-10)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added extension method &lt;code&gt;BicepValueExtensions.ToBicepExpression&lt;/code&gt; which converts any &lt;code&gt;IBicepValue&lt;/code&gt; into &lt;code&gt;BicepExpression&lt;/code&gt; to build up complex expressions in bicep. For more details, please refer to the documents in &lt;code&gt;README&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabled the ability to assign expressions into a property with type of a &lt;code&gt;ProvisionableConstruct&lt;/code&gt; via low level APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed exception when output variable has a type of array or object.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed bug when indexing output list or dictionary, a &lt;code&gt;KeyNotFoundException&lt;/code&gt; was always thrown. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/issues/48491" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/issues/48491/hovercard"&gt;#48491&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
